Thank you for your answer. <br><br>At this moment in my radio the firmware installed is  GD-77_V4.3.9.sgl that I have downloaded and installes few day ago from the last version of software available in the Radioddity WEB page <a href="https://www.radioddity.com/pages/radioddity-download" class="postlink">https://www.radioddity.com/pages/radioddity-download</a>. <br><br>I read in the <strong class="text-strong">OpenGD77 firmware installation</strong> document that the firmware file versión that I sould use is GD-77_V4.3.6.sgl file . <br><br>I have two questions:<br><br>1.-  Will the extras/firmware loader work correctly with version 4.3.9? . I have read in the same document that "Firmware loader can merge the OpenGD77 firmware with the codec from the official firmware" and I dont know if it will work also with this last version ( is not the 4.3.6 ) .<br><br>2.- Once the firmware is <strong class="text-strong">installed and merged</strong> with the OpenGD77 "extras/firmware loader", will I be able to go back to the original firmware or the original factory state of the radio? .<br><br>Thank you in advance for your support.<br><br>Fernando, EC3A.<br><div class="inline-attachment"><dl class="file"><dt class="attach-image"><img src="http://localhost/opengd77/download/file.php?id=2052&amp;sid=dd846ffac38c08befe222d484e912938" class="postimage" alt="Captura.PNG" onclick="viewableArea(this);" /></dt></dl></div><div class="inline-attachment"><dl class="file"><dt class="attach-image"><img src="http://localhost/opengd77/download/file.php?id=2053&amp;sid=dd846ffac38c08befe222d484e912938" class="postimage" alt="Captura1.PNG" onclick="viewableArea(this);" /></dt></dl></div><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=5202">EC3A</a> — Tue Dec 26, 2023 12:25 pm</p><hr />
