		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=3616&amp;p=28249#p28249"><![CDATA[
Have you loaded the OpenGD77 firmware into the radio from the extras/firmware loader menu as detailed in the instructions? <br>The Com port will not appear until this has been done. The CPS cannot be used with the original manufacturers firmware. <br>Loading the firmware does not use the com port.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=87">G4EML</a> — Mon Dec 25, 2023 5:34 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
